  "term": "posture",
  "definition": "Posture is the way the body is aligned in relation to gravity and the surrounding environment, as well as how its different parts are positioned relative to one another. In psychology-related contexts, it is also understood as a dynamic aspect of behavior that helps people interact with their surroundings and communicate intentions or attitudes.",
